Welcome to the Homeroom live stream.

00:00:04.668 --> 00:00:07.738
Before we jump into our
very exciting conversation

00:00:07.738 --> 00:00:09.608
with our guest Marley Dias,

00:00:09.608 --> 00:00:12.578
I'm, I'll give my standard
announcements or reminder

00:00:12.578 --> 00:00:14.478
that we are not for profit organization.

00:00:14.478 --> 00:00:16.168
So if you're in a position to do so,

00:00:16.168 --> 00:00:17.558
please think about making a donation

00:00:17.558 --> 00:00:20.578
at khanacademy.org/donate.

00:00:20.578 --> 00:00:22.758
We can only exist through
philanthropic donations

00:00:22.758 --> 00:00:24.748
from folks like yourself.

00:00:24.748 --> 00:00:27.438
Also wanna give a shout out
to several organizations

00:00:27.438 --> 00:00:28.528
that have stepped up.

00:00:28.528 --> 00:00:31.738
We were already running a
deficit pre-Covid, Covid hits,

