00:25:24.618 --> 00:25:27.358
- Well, I think one thing I
always wanna say to people

00:25:27.358 --> 00:25:29.328
about social action is that,

00:25:29.328 --> 00:25:33.348
I am not trying to prove
anything to anybody.

00:25:33.348 --> 00:25:34.528
And I think for a lot of people,

00:25:34.528 --> 00:25:37.698
