00:25:37.698 --> 00:25:38.588
that they're not good enough

00:25:38.588 --> 00:25:40.248
and they're actively doing something

00:25:40.248 --> 00:25:42.148
because someone told them they can't,

00:25:42.148 --> 00:25:43.438
but it's also really important

00:25:43.438 --> 00:25:45.078
to always work in the positive.

00:25:45.078 --> 00:25:47.688
The work I do is because I love to read

00:25:47.688 --> 00:25:49.248
and I want to see more books

00:25:49.248 --> 00:25:51.078
where black girls are the main characters.

00:25:51.078 --> 00:25:53.218
I don't start 1000 black girl books.

00:25:53.218 --> 00:25:54.558
And I didn't start this campaign

00:25:54.558 --> 00:25:56.478
