systemic racism in this country

00:26:29.438 --> 00:26:32.068
and me not having books is a part of that.

00:26:32.068 --> 00:26:35.078
But also understanding that
what I can do is hopefully

00:26:35.078 --> 00:26:38.368
be a small part of this
chain of activists,

00:26:38.368 --> 00:26:41.058
of leaders, of powerhouses, of creatives

00:26:41.058 --> 00:26:43.868
that will hopefully break
apart this horrible system.

00:26:43.868 --> 00:26:46.318
So I think when I talk
about 1000 black girl books,

00:26:46.318 --> 00:26:49.438
I always wanna talk about it
as something that is great.

00:26:49.438 --> 00:26:50.428
That is amazing.

00:26:50.428 --> 00:26:51.378
Than rather than saying,

00:26:51.378 --> 00:26:53.808
I'm trying to end
something that is horrible

00:26:53.808 --> 00:26:56.178
and that is disgusting
