your mission statements,

00:27:04.918 --> 00:27:06.358
your ideas, your thoughts,

00:27:06.358 --> 00:27:08.508
and your feelings about
changing the world.

00:27:09.938 --> 00:27:11.668
- Well, Marley, I gotta
say, I think you just,

